<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uk" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Artem Tarnopolskyi — Профіль</title>
    <script src="theme.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="theme.css">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .profile-container {
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 48px auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        .profile-card {
            background: var(--theme-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--theme-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 36px;
            transition: background 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .profile-card h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: var(--theme-text);
        }

        .profile-card .role {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--theme-accent);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .profile-field {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
            padding: 14px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--theme-border);
        }

        .profile-field:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .profile-field .label {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            color: var(--theme-text-dim);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .profile-field .value {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--theme-text);
        }

        .profile-field .value a {
            color: var(--theme-link);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .profile-field .value a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="site-navbar">
        <a class="nav-brand" href="team_profiles/IndexAR.html">SoftServe Team</a>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="team_profiles/IndexAR.html">Головна</a></li>
            <li><a href="TeamMember2profile" class="active">Artem</a></li>
            <li><a href="team_profiles/IKiritoII Profile/index.html">Yehor</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="nav-right">
            <button id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Перемкнути тему">🌙 Темна</button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="profile-container">
        <div class="profile-card">
            <h1>Artem Tarnopolskyi</h1>
            <p class="role">Team Member</p>

            <div class="profile-field">
                <span class="label">Опис</span>
                <span class="value">Студент комп'ютерної інженерії, цікавлюсь hardware частиною комп'ютера.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="profile-field">
                <span class="label">Контакти</span>
                <span class="value">
                    <a href="mailto:artem.tarnopolskyi@nure.ua">artem.tarnopolskyi@nure.ua</a>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
